{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>天堂官方授權的NS2 microSD Ex高性能卡是貼着任天堂馬裏奧LOGO的高性能存儲卡。早在當年伴隨Switch 2同期推出知識就因為價格昂貴備受關注，如今的價格更加誇張。</p>\n<p>·該卡由任天堂授權，三星與閃迪代工，其中 256GB班原價6980日元，如今已經變成了8980日元，價格暴漲近三成。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"任天堂官方授權NS2 microSD Ex高性能卡悄然漲價近三成\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260818/1787015637_586608.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"任天堂官方授權NS2 microSD Ex高性能卡悄然漲價近三成\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260818/1787015637_517146.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"任天堂官方授權NS2 microSD Ex高性能卡悄然漲價近三成\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260818/1787015627_144341.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"任天堂官方授權NS2 microSD Ex高性能卡悄然漲價近三成\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260818/1787015637_586608.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"任天堂官方授權NS2 microSD Ex高性能卡悄然漲價近三成\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260818/1787015637_517146.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T02:19:55.948485+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":5,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}